  {'id': 'anx_mindful_see_5m', 'title': 'Mindful Seeing', 'description': 'Look around and really see. Notice shapes, shadows, light patterns, and colors as if seeing them for the first time.', 'conditionType': 'anxiety', 'category': 'mindfulness', 'durationMinutes': 5, 'timeOfDay': 'anytime', 'difficulty': 'easy'},
  {'id': 'anx_present_moment_5m', 'title': 'Present Moment Anchor', 'description': 'Bring your attention fully to the present moment. Focus on where you are, what you\'re doing, and how your body feels right now.', 'conditionType': 'anxiety', 'category': 'mindfulness', 'durationMinutes': 5, 'timeOfDay': 'anytime', 'difficulty': 'easy'},
  {'id': 'anx_shake_3m', 'title': 'Body Shaking Release', 'description': 'Stand up and shake your whole body — hands, arms, legs, torso. Animals do this to release stress. Shake for 3 minutes.', 'conditionType': 'anxiety', 'category': 'physicalTask', 'durationMinutes': 3, 'timeOfDay': 'anytime', 'difficulty': 'easy'},
  {'id': 'anx_jaw_release_3m', 'title': 'Jaw Release', 'description': 'Open your mouth wide, move your jaw side to side, massage the jaw muscles. Release the tension you hold in your face.', 'conditionType': 'anxiety', 'category': 'physicalTask', 'durationMinutes': 3, 'timeOfDay': 'anytime', 'difficulty': 'easy'},
  {'id': 'anx_shoulder_drop_3m', 'title': 'Shoulder Drop Exercise', 'description': 'Raise your shoulders to your ears, hold 5 seconds, then drop them completely. Repeat 10 times. Notice the tension leaving.', 'conditionType': 'anxiety', 'category': 'physicalTask', 'durationMinutes': 3, 'timeOfDay': 'anytime', 'difficulty': 'easy'},
  {'id': 'anx_bilateral_tap_5m', 'title': 'Bilateral Tapping', 'description': 'Alternately tap your knees, shoulders, or cross your arms and tap. The bilateral stimulation helps process anxiety.', 'conditionType': 'anxiety', 'category': 'groundingExercise', 'durationMinutes': 5, 'timeOfDay': 'anytime', 'difficulty': 'easy'},
  {'id': 'anx_feet_ground_3m', 'title': 'Feet on Ground', 'description': 'Press your feet firmly into the ground. Feel the connection to the earth. You are here, you are stable, you are grounded.', 'conditionType': 'anxiety', 'category': 'groundingExercise', 'durationMinutes': 3, 'timeOfDay': 'anytime', 'difficulty': 'easy'},
  {'id': 'anx_palm_press_2m', 'title': 'Palm Press Technique', 'description': 'Press your palms together firmly in front of your chest for 10 seconds, then release. Repeat 5 times. Grounds through pressure.', 'conditionType': 'anxiety', 'category': 'groundingExercise', 'durationMinutes': 2, 'timeOfDay': 'anytime', 'difficulty': 'easy'},
  {'id': 'anx_worry_tree_5m', 'title': 'Worry Tree Decision', 'description': 'Ask: Can I do something about this? If yes — plan action. If no — practice letting go. Use this decision tree for your top worry.', 'conditionType': 'anxiety', 'category': 'cognitiveTask', 'durationMinutes': 5, 'timeOfDay': 'anytime', 'difficulty': 'easy'},
  {'id': 'anx_probability_5m', 'title': 'Probability Assessment', 'description': 'Rate the actual probability (0-100%) that your feared outcome will happen. Then rate how bad it would really be. Compare to your fear level.', 'conditionType': 'anxiety', 'category': 'cognitiveTask', 'durationMinutes': 5, 'timeOfDay': 'anytime', 'difficulty': 'medium'},
  {'id': 'anx_cope_card_5m', 'title': 'Coping Card Creation', 'description': 'Write a card with your top 3 coping strategies and an encouraging statement. Keep it accessible for anxious moments.', 'conditionType': 'anxiety', 'category': 'cognitiveTask', 'durationMinutes': 5, 'timeOfDay': 'morning', 'difficulty': 'easy'},
  {'id': 'anx_safety_list_5m', 'title': 'Safety Behaviors Review', 'description': 'List your anxiety safety behaviors (avoidance, checking, reassurance seeking). Pick one to gently challenge this week.', 'conditionType': 'anxiety', 'category': 'cognitiveTask', 'durationMinutes': 5, 'timeOfDay': 'morning', 'difficulty': 'medium'},
  {'id': 'anx_strength_recall_5m', 'title': 'Strength Recall', 'description': 'Remember a time you faced something scary and got through it. How did you cope? Remind yourself of your proven resilience.', 'conditionType': 'anxiety', 'category': 'cognitiveTask', 'durationMinutes': 5, 'timeOfDay': 'anytime', 'difficulty': 'easy'},
  {'id': 'anx_past_success_5m', 'title': 'Past Success Review', 'description': 'List 3 times your worried prediction didn\'t come true. How did reality compare to your fear? Build evidence that you can cope.', 'conditionType': 'anxiety', 'category': 'cognitiveTask', 'durationMinutes': 5, 'timeOfDay': 'anytime', 'difficulty': 'easy'},
  {'id': 'anx_gratitude_calm_5m', 'title': 'Calm Gratitude Reflection', 'description': 'Think of 3 things that bring you calm and peace. Describe why each one soothes you. Let gratitude quiet the anxiety.', 'conditionType': 'anxiety', 'category': 'journalingTask', 'durationMinutes': 5, 'timeOfDay': 'evening', 'difficulty': 'easy'},
  {'id': 'anx_sensory_kit_5m', 'title': 'Sensory Comfort Kit', 'description': 'Gather items that soothe each sense: a soft blanket, calming scent, warm tea, gentle music. Use them for 5 minutes.', 'conditionType': 'anxiety', 'category': 'selfCareTask', 'durationMinutes': 5, 'timeOfDay': 'evening', 'difficulty': 'easy'},
  {'id': 'anx_humor_5m', 'title': 'Find Something Funny', 'description': 'Watch a funny video, read a joke, or recall a hilarious memory. Laughter is a powerful antidote to anxiety.', 'conditionType': 'anxiety', 'category': 'selfCareTask', 'durationMinutes': 5, 'timeOfDay': 'anytime', 'difficulty': 'easy'},
  {'id': 'anx_stretch_calm_5m', 'title': 'Calming Stretches', 'description': 'Do slow, gentle stretches focusing on neck, shoulders, and back where anxiety tension builds. Hold each stretch 20 seconds.', 'conditionType': 'anxiety', 'category': 'physicalTask', 'durationMinutes': 5, 'timeOfDay': 'anytime', 'difficulty': 'easy'},
  {'id': 'anx_music_calm_10m', 'title': 'Calming Music Session', 'description': 'Put on calm, slow music (60 BPM or less). Close your eyes and let the music carry away your tension for 10 minutes.', 'conditionType': 'anxiety', 'category': 'selfCareTask', 'durationMinutes': 10, 'timeOfDay': 'evening', 'difficulty': 'easy'},
  {'id': 'anx_tea_ritual_10m', 'title': 'Mindful Tea Ritual', 'description': 'Make tea slowly and mindfully. Watch the water boil, smell the leaves, feel the warmth of the cup. Sip with full attention.', 'conditionType': 'anxiety', 'category': 'mindfulness', 'durationMinutes': 10, 'timeOfDay': 'afternoon', 'difficulty': 'easy'},
  {'id': 'anx_pet_interact_10m', 'title': 'Pet Interaction', 'description': 'Spend 10 minutes with an animal — pet a cat or dog, watch fish, listen to birds. Animal presence lowers anxiety naturally.', 'conditionType': 'anxiety', 'category': 'selfCareTask', 'durationMinutes': 10, 'timeOfDay': 'anytime', 'difficulty': 'easy'},
  {'id': 'anx_draw_feelings_10m', 'title': 'Draw Your Feelings', 'description': 'Draw or doodle what your anxiety looks like. Give it a shape, color, and size. Then draw it getting smaller.', 'conditionType': 'anxiety', 'category': 'creativeTask', 'durationMinutes': 10, 'timeOfDay': 'anytime', 'difficulty': 'easy'},

